        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">The company KFN works on a technically high level. Effective dust control systems are installed.\n\n# Included processes\nIncludes the processes: crushing, milling, filtering (cyclone), dedusting, transportation, and storing. One part of the total heating energy for "production" and "administration" is included. Equipment included in the infrastructure: 1 crusher, 1 roller mill, 1 plant for dedusting, 1cyclone, and 1 small silo.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
